  "id": "wild-rice-soup",
  "name": "Wild Rice Soup",
  "subtitle": "A creamy soup with wild rice, vegetables, ham, and almonds.",
  "description": "Tender wild rice and shredded carrots simmer in a smooth, buttery broth finished with half-and-half.",
